BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e5710ad0d46215d66f573e5d
SUMMARY:Cincinnati Coffee Festival 2026 
DTSTAMP:20260908T080405Z
DTSTART:20261024T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:Deja brew!! We’re back for the 2026 Cincinnati Coffee Festival\
	, the premier caffeinated event in the Midwest! With two days of coffee\, 
	tea\, chocolate\, demonstrations\, latte art\, and fun\, this is a can’t-m
	iss event. Limited capacity. Most time slots will sell out. Ticket prices 
	include all fees and charges. Please consider adding a donation for Ohio R
	iver Foundation\, producer of the Cincinnati Coffee Festival. After all\, 
	Great Water Means Great Coffee! Enter at the time of your ticket and stay 
	as long as you like. a { text-decoration: none\; color: #464feb\; } tr th\
	, tr td { border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\; } tr th { background-color: #f5f5f5\
	; } Coffee Connoisseur Weekend Pass BUY WEEKEND PASS Advance Price $42 Day
	 Of Price $49 Looking for the ticket that delivers maximum flexibility and
	 the ultimate festival experience? The Coffee Connoisseur Weekend Pass is 
	your all‑access pass to a brew‑tiful weekend. With this pass\, you can att
	end both Saturday and Sunday—no need to choose just one day. Enjoy demos\,
	 live music\, the Latte Art Throwdown\, tastings\, shopping\, and more eac
	h day. If one day simply isn’t enough\, come back for round two! Each day 
	features different music\, different demonstrations\, and new tasting oppo
	rtunities. Special Events included\, like the Latte Art Throwdown (Saturda
	y at 2:15 PM) and Coffee & Chocolate Pairing (Sunday at 2:15 PM)\, as well
	 as all demonstrations and musical performances. Bagels served until 9am. 
	Daily Experiences & Entry Times ☕ VIP First Pour Advance Price $30 Day Of 
	Price $37 8:00am VIP First Pour Bagels served until 9:00am It smells like 
	coffee! Kick off your festival day with early VIP access. VIP First Pour g
	uests enjoy a calm\, crowd‑free shopping and tasting hour before general a
	dmission opens. With shorter lines and first pick of specialty chocolates\
	, coffees\, and artisan treats\, it’s the perfect time to connect with ven
	dors\, ask questions\, and explore with ease. 🌅 Early Brew Advance Price $
	23 Day Of Price $29 9:00am Early Brew Start\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.
	org/events/detail/cincinnati-coffee-festival-2026
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/cincinnati-coffee-festival
	-2026
LOCATION:Music Hall Ballroom\, Music Hall
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Other
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
